/- English proof (translation)
Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Express the relevant assertion in an equivalent form by its definition. Express the relevant assertion in an equivalent form by its definition. Establish an intermediate fact.

